msgid ""
"Scaling up changes only the inputs, so the next step is to combine the four stages into one function\n"
"and run it twice, both times on a 40-qubit register in the $pf$ shell above a\n"
"$^{40}\\mathrm{Ca}$ core with the GXPF1 interaction [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Menskala naik hanya menukar input, jadi langkah seterusnya ialah menggabungkan empat peringkat menjadi satu fungsi\n"
"dan menjalankannya dua kali, kedua-duanya pada register 40-qubit dalam cengkerang $pf$ di atas\n"
"teras $^{40}\\mathrm{Ca}$ dengan interaksi GXPF1 [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two runs illustrate different aspects of scaling:\n"
msgstr "Dua larian ini menggambarkan aspek penskalaan yang berbeza:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$^{44}\\mathrm{Ti}$, two valence protons and two valence neutrons, has a 4,000-determinant basis. The\n"
"register is 40 qubits, but the problem is still small enough to diagonalize exactly on a laptop, so\n"
"you can compare the hardware result with an exact reference after increasing the register size.\n"
msgstr ""
"$^{44}\\mathrm{Ti}$, dua proton valens dan dua neutron valens, mempunyai asas 4,000-penentu. Register\n"
"ialah 40 qubit, tetapi masalah masih cukup kecil untuk didiagonalisasi secara tepat pada komputer riba, jadi\n"
"anda boleh membandingkan hasil perkakasan dengan rujukan tepat selepas menaikkan saiz register.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$^{48}\\mathrm{Cr}$, four valence protons and four valence neutrons, has 1,963,461 symmetry-allowed determinants in the same 40 qubits.\n"
"The tutorial's dense solver cannot diagonalize that full space, so the run returns\n"
"a rigorous upper bound and the reference determinant it improves on.\n"
msgstr ""
"$^{48}\\mathrm{Cr}$, empat proton valens dan empat neutron valens, mempunyai 1,963,461 penentu yang dibenarkan-simetri dalam 40 qubit yang sama.\n"
"Penyelesai tumpat tutorial ini tidak boleh mendiagonalisasi ruang penuh itu, jadi larian ini mengembalikan\n"
"sempadan atas yang tegar dan penentu rujukan yang diperbaikinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Watch two quantities across the two runs. The fraction of the pool that fits inside the fixed gate\n"
"budget shrinks as the pool grows, and `pack_ensemble` reports how much is included. The\n"
"subspace stops being limited by sampling and starts being limited by `MAX_DIMENSION`, the largest\n"
"matrix the dense classical solver here builds. At this scale, a production\n"
"calculation would use a selected configuration interaction (selected-CI) solver.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan dua kuantiti merentas kedua-dua larian. Pecahan kolam yang muat di dalam belanjawan get\n"
"tetap mengecil apabila kolam membesar, dan `pack_ensemble` melaporkan berapa banyak yang disertakan. Subruang\n"
"berhenti dihadkan oleh pensampelan dan mula dihadkan oleh `MAX_DIMENSION`, matriks terbesar yang\n"
"dibina oleh penyelesai klasik tumpat di sini. Pada skala ini, pengiraan pengeluaran\n"
"akan menggunakan penyelesai interaksi konfigurasi terpilih (selected-CI).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
