# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary {#summary}"
msgstr "Ringkasan {#summary}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One workflow, unchanged apart from its inputs, ran on a QPU at three problem sizes: a 24-qubit\n"
"problem you can check exactly, a 40-qubit problem you can still check exactly, and a 40-qubit problem\n"
"with nearly two million basis states beyond this tutorial's exact-diagonalization capacity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu aliran kerja, tidak berubah kecuali inputnya, dijalankan pada QPU pada tiga saiz masalah: masalah 24-qubit\n"
"yang boleh anda semak secara tepat, masalah 40-qubit yang masih boleh anda semak secara tepat, dan masalah 40-qubit\n"
"dengan hampir dua juta keadaan asas yang melangkaui kapasiti diagonalisasi-tepat tutorial ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three runs illustrate the following points:\n"
msgstr "Tiga larian ini menggambarkan perkara berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The quantum step only has to propose determinants.** The circuit is fixed, seeded from\n"
"second-order perturbation theory, and never optimized. Nothing in the workflow needs its amplitudes\n"
"to be accurate, only its support to be useful. Classical diagonalization in the selected subspace gives a\n"
"variational upper bound, although the bound varies with the sampled configurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Langkah kuantum hanya perlu mencadangkan penentu.** Litar adalah tetap, disemai daripada\n"
"teori gangguan peringkat kedua, dan tidak pernah dioptimumkan. Tiada apa-apa dalam aliran kerja yang memerlukan amplitudnya\n"
"tepat, hanya sokongannya perlu berguna. Diagonalisasi klasik dalam subruang terpilih memberikan\n"
"sempadan atas variasional, walaupun sempadan berubah mengikut konfigurasi yang disampel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Qubit excitations reduce circuit depth.** Because only the support matters, the fermionic excitation blocks\n"
"can be replaced by qubit excitations, whose cost does not grow with the distance between the\n"
"orbitals they connect. Step 2 measured the saving on the actual backend, which is the difference\n"
"between a circuit that fits comfortably inside coherence and one that does not.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengujaan qubit mengurangkan kedalaman litar.** Kerana hanya sokongan yang penting, blok pengujaan fermionik\n"
"boleh digantikan dengan pengujaan qubit, yang kosnya tidak bertambah dengan jarak antara\n"
"orbital yang dihubungkannya. Langkah 2 mengukur penjimatan itu pada backend sebenar, iaitu perbezaan\n"
"antara litar yang muat selesa di dalam koheren dan yang tidak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configuration recovery reuses noisy samples.** Every shot with the wrong proton or neutron number is repaired\n"
"against the current occupancy estimate rather than discarded, and each repaired half-configuration\n"
"can add configurations to the subspace. Widening a variational subspace cannot raise its lowest\n"
"eigenvalue. This tutorial demonstrates configuration recovery using hardware samples.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pemulihan konfigurasi menggunakan semula sampel berhingar.** Setiap shot dengan bilangan proton atau neutron yang salah dibaiki\n"
"menggunakan anggaran kependudukan semasa dan bukannya dibuang, dan setiap separuh-konfigurasi yang dibaiki\n"
"boleh menambah konfigurasi kepada subruang. Meluaskan subruang variasional tidak boleh menaikkan nilai eigen\n"
"terendahnya. Tutorial ini menunjukkan pemulihan konfigurasi menggunakan sampel perkakasan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The binding constraint moves as you scale.** At 24 qubits the ansatz could reach the exact answer,\n"
"and only sampling stood in the way. At 40 qubits with four valence nucleons per species, the gate\n"
"budget covers a minority of the pool and the dense classical solver caps the subspace. Knowing which\n"
"of the three is limiting you is the practical skill this workflow teaches.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kekangan pengikat berubah apabila anda meningkatkan skala.** Pada 24 qubit, ansatz boleh mencapai jawapan tepat,\n"
"dan hanya pensampelan yang menghalang. Pada 40 qubit dengan empat nukleon valens bagi setiap spesies, belanjawan\n"
"get hanya merangkumi minoriti kolam dan penyelesai klasik tumpat mengehadkan subruang. Mengetahui yang mana\n"
"daripada tiga-tiga itu yang menghadkan anda ialah kemahiran praktikal yang diajar aliran kerja ini.\n"

